<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<title>산불발생위험도 보고서</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #ffffff;
    --surface: #ffffff;
    --surface-2: #f4f4f5;
    --ink: #111827;
    --ink-soft: #4b5563;
    --muted: #6b7280;
    --line: #e5e7eb;
    --accent: #111827;
    --accent-strong: #111827;
    --accent-ink: #ffffff;
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; font-family: "Noto Sans KR", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif; }

  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: "Noto Sans KR", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;
    print-color-adjust: exact;
  }

  .doc { max-width: 100%; padding: 0 28px; }

  /* 섹션은 기본적으로 자연스럽게 흘러 페이지를 빈틈없이 채운다.
     표지(.cover-page)만 별도 타이틀 페이지로 강제 분리한다. */
  section.spread {
    padding: 12px 0 14px;
  }
  section.spread.cover-page {
    break-after: page;
    page-break-after: always;
  }
  .spread + .spread {
    margin-top: 8px;
    padding-top: 14px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .cover-page + .spread {
    margin-top: 0;
    border-top: none;
  }

  .sec-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 9px;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    break-after: avoid;
    break-inside: avoid;
    page-break-after: avoid;
    page-break-inside: avoid;
  }
  .sec-dot {
    flex: none;
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    margin-top: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent);
  }
  .sec-head .titles { min-width: 0; flex: 1; }

  h1.page-title, h2.page-title {
    font-family: "Noto Sans KR", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 4px;
    color: var(--ink);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  h1.page-title { font-size: 28px; line-height: 1.25; }
  h2.page-title { font-size: 23px; }

  .lede { max-width: 80ch; color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 14px; margin: 0 0 10px; }
  .lede.one-line { max-width: none; white-space: nowrap; }
  .lede strong { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 700; }
  p.copy { max-width: 80ch; color: var(--ink-soft); margin: 0; font-size: 14px; word-break: keep-all; overflow-wrap: normal; }
  p.copy strong { color: var(--ink); }
  .footnote { font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 8px; }
  svg text { font-family: "Noto Sans KR", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif; }
  hr.rule {
    border: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    margin: 8px 0;
  }

  /* ---------- Gauge (표지 대형) ---------- */
  .gauge-wrap { position: relative; width: 420px; height: 420px; flex: none; }
  .gauge-wrap.hero { width: 500px; height: 500px; }
  .gauge-wrap svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; }
  .gauge-center {
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    top: 46%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    width: 198px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .gauge-number { font-size: 58px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; line-height: 1; }
  .gauge-scale { font-size: 15px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 6px; }
  .gauge-band-label { margin-top: 8px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; padding: 4px 13px; border-radius: 999px; }

  .kpi-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 10px; }
  .kpi {
    border: 1px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--surface);
    break-inside: avoid;
  }
  .kpi-head {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent-ink);
    font-size: 13.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 7px 9px;
  }
  .kpi-body { padding: 10px 9px 13px; text-align: center; }
  .kpi-desc { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); min-height: 1.2em; }
  .kpi-val { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; margin-top: 3px; letter-spacing: -0.03em; }
  .kpi-val small { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--muted); }

  /* ---------- Ranking ---------- */
  .rank-list { column-count: 2; column-gap: 20px; }
  .rank-list.compact { column-count: 2; }
  .rank-section {
    break-inside: avoid;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .rank-section-label {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: 0 0 6px;
    padding-bottom: 4px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .rank-row {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 24px 122px minmax(0, 1fr) 42px;
    align-items: center; gap: 7px; padding: 3px 2px; break-inside: avoid;
  }
  .rank-row .r { font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--muted); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .rank-row .name { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
  .rank-row.top .name { color: var(--accent-strong); font-weight: 800; }
  .rank-row.highlight .name { text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: var(--accent); text-underline-offset: 2px; }
  .rank-track { position: relative; height: 8px; background: var(--surface-2); border-radius: 999px; overflow: hidden; }
  .rank-fill { position: absolute; inset: 0 auto 0 0; border-radius: 999px; }
  .rank-row .val { font-size: 12px; text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: var(--ink-soft); }

  .legend-bar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 10px;
    padding: 7px 11px;
    background: var(--surface-2);
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: var(--muted);
    break-inside: avoid;
    page-break-inside: avoid;
  }
  .legend-items {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, auto);
    gap: 4px 12px;
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .legend-item { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; white-space: nowrap; }
  .legend-item .dot { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; flex: none; }
  .legend-hint { flex: none; text-align: right; white-space: nowrap; font-size: 11px; }

  /* ---------- Comparison ---------- */
  .range-card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 14px 16px 10px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    break-inside: avoid;
  }
  .range-strip { position: relative; margin: 32px 4px 24px; }
  .range-track { height: 11px; border-radius: 999px; overflow: hidden; display: flex; }
  .range-track span { flex: 1; }
  .range-marker { position: absolute; top: -32px; transform: translateX(-50%); display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; font-size: 10.5px; white-space: nowrap; }
  .range-marker .stem { width: 1px; height: 13px; background: var(--muted); margin-top: 2px; }
  .range-marker.emph .stem { background: var(--accent-strong); width: 2px; }
  .range-marker .lbl { color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; }
  .range-marker.emph .lbl { color: var(--accent-strong); font-weight: 800; }
  .range-marker .num { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: var(--ink); font-weight: 700; }
  .range-marker.below { top: auto; bottom: -32px; flex-direction: column-reverse; }
  .range-marker.below .stem { margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 2px; }

  .section-label {
    font-size: 12.5px; letter-spacing: 0.02em; color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 7px; font-weight: 700;
    break-after: avoid; page-break-after: avoid;
  }

  /* 시·도 비교 차트 (가로 막대 + 전국 평균선) */
  .prov-chart {
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
    break-inside: avoid;
    page-break-inside: avoid;
  }
  .prov-chart-meta {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 7px 11px;
    background: var(--surface-2);
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .prov-chart-meta .keys { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
  .prov-chart-meta .key { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; }
  .prov-chart-meta .swatch-bar {
    width: 14px; height: 8px; border-radius: 2px; background: #1e3a5f;
  }
  .prov-chart-meta .swatch-line {
    width: 14px; height: 0; border-top: 2px dashed #c2410c;
  }
  .prov-chart-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 84px minmax(0, 1fr) 46px;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 9px;
    padding: 4px 11px;
    break-inside: avoid;
  }
  .prov-chart-row.alt { background: #f9fafb; }
  .prov-chart-row.target { background: #eff6ff; }
  .prov-chart-row .name {
    font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600;
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .prov-chart-row.target .name { font-weight: 800; color: var(--accent-strong); }
  .prov-chart-track {
    position: relative;
    height: 16px;
    background: #eef2f7;
    border-radius: 3px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .prov-chart-fill {
    position: absolute; inset: 0 auto 0 0; border-radius: 3px;
    background: #1e3a5f;
    min-width: 2px;
  }
  .prov-chart-row.target .prov-chart-fill { background: #0f172a; }
  .prov-chart-avg {
    position: absolute; top: 0; bottom: 0; width: 0;
    border-left: 1.5px dashed #c2410c;
    z-index: 2;
  }
  .prov-chart-row .val {
    font-size: 12.5px; text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: var(--ink-soft); font-weight: 700;
  }
  .badge { font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 800; background: var(--accent); color: var(--accent-ink); border-radius: 999px; padding: 2px 7px; }

  /* ---------- Spotlight rows ---------- */
  .spot-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .spot-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 240px;
    gap: 14px;
    align-items: center;
    border: 1px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 10px 14px 12px;
    background: var(--surface);
    break-inside: avoid;
  }
  .spot-main { min-width: 0; }
  .spot-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 9px;
    margin-bottom: 3px;
  }
  .spot-rank { font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--muted); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; font-weight: 700; }
  .spot-name { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .spot-head .chip { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--muted); }
  .spot-head .swatch { width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; }
  .spot-idx { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: var(--accent-strong); line-height: 1; margin: 3px 0 8px; }
  .spot-idx small { font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; }
  .compare { position: relative; height: 5px; background: var(--surface-2); border-radius: 999px; margin: 18px 2px 20px; }
  .compare i { position: absolute; top: -5px; width: 2px; height: 15px; background: var(--muted); }
  .compare i.self { background: var(--accent-strong); width: 3px; }
  .compare em { position: absolute; top: -18px; transform: translateX(-50%); font-style: normal; font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--muted); white-space: nowrap; }
  .compare em.self { color: var(--accent-strong); font-weight: 800; }
  .compare em.below { top: auto; bottom: -16px; }

  .wx-mini {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    table-layout: fixed;
    background: var(--surface-2);
    border-radius: 6px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .wx-mini th {
    font-size: 10.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--muted);
    text-align: center;
    padding: 6px 3px 2px;
  }
  .wx-mini td {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 2px 3px 8px;
  }
  .wx-mini td small { font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--muted); }

  /* ---------- Methodology ---------- */
  .method-grid {
    display: flex;
    gap: 24px;
    align-items: flex-start;
    break-inside: avoid;
    page-break-inside: avoid;
  }
  .method-grid > div { flex: 1 1 0; min-width: 0; }
  .stat-line {
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 6px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); font-size: 13px;
    break-inside: avoid; page-break-inside: avoid;
  }
  .stat-line span:first-child { color: var(--muted); }
  .stat-line span:last-child { font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }

  ul.guide { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 7px; }
  ul.guide li { display: flex; gap: 8px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-soft); break-inside: avoid; page-break-inside: avoid; }
  ul.guide li::before { content: ""; flex: none; width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-top: 6px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent); }

  .report-footer {
    margin-top: 16px;
    padding-top: 9px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 11px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .report-footer strong { color: var(--ink-soft); }

  /* ---------- Cover sheet ---------- */
  .cover-sheet {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 178mm;
    padding: 12px 0 16px 18px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .cover-accent {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 8px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #166534 0%, #166534 48%, #b91c1c 52%, #b91c1c 100%);
    border-radius: 2px;
  }
  .cover-left {
    flex: 1 1 auto;
    min-width: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .cover-right {
    flex: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding-right: 0;
  }
  .cover-banner {
    display: inline-block;
    align-self: flex-start;
    background: #111827;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    padding: 10px 20px;
    margin: 10px 0 24px;
  }
  .cover-main-title {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-size: 44px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: #111827;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .cover-sub {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #166534;
  }
  .cover-rule {
    border: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
  }
  .cover-meta {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 78px 1fr;
    gap: 13px 14px;
    max-width: 440px;
    font-size: 16px;
  }
  .cover-meta dt {
    margin: 0;
    color: #6b7280;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .cover-meta dd {
    margin: 0;
    color: #111827;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .cover-summary {
    margin-top: 24px;
    max-width: 42ch;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: #4b5563;
    word-break: keep-all;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="doc">

  <!-- 0: 표지 (제목·메타 + 요약·게이지) -->
  <section class="spread cover-page" id="p0">
    <div class="cover-sheet">
      <div class="cover-accent" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="cover-left">
        <div class="cover-banner">{{ cover_meta.banner }}</div>
        <h1 class="cover-main-title">{{ cover_meta.title }}</h1>
        <p class="cover-sub">{{ cover_meta.subtitle }}</p>
        <hr class="cover-rule" />
        <dl class="cover-meta">
          <dt>발행일</dt>
          <dd>{{ cover_meta.issued_at }}</dd>
          <dt>작성</dt>
          <dd>{{ cover_meta.author }}</dd>
          <dt>닉네임</dt>
          <dd>{{ cover_meta.nickname }}</dd>
        </dl>
        <p class="cover-summary">{{ narrative.cover }}{% if narrative.cover_avg %} {{ narrative.cover_avg }}{% endif %}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cover-right">
        <div class="gauge-wrap hero">
          <svg viewBox="-90 -80 480 460" width="500" height="500" role="img" aria-label="{{ province }} 평균 산불위험지수 {{ province_stat.avg }}, 100점 만점">
            {% for arc in gauge.arcs %}
            <path d="{{ arc.path }}" stroke="{{ arc.color }}" stroke-width="22" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            {% endfor %}
            <line x1="150" y1="150" x2="{{ gauge.needle.x }}" y2="{{ gauge.needle.y }}" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <circle cx="150" cy="150" r="8" fill="var(--ink)"/>
            {% for t in gauge.ticks %}
            <text x="{{ t.x }}" y="{{ t.y + 4 }}" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="var(--muted)">{{ t.v }}</text>
            {% endfor %}
            {% for c in gauge.captions %}
            <line x1="{{ c.dot_x }}" y1="{{ c.dot_y }}" x2="{{ c.bx }}" y2="{{ c.by }}" stroke="#4b5563" stroke-width="1.3"/>
            <circle cx="{{ c.dot_x }}" cy="{{ c.dot_y }}" r="4.5" fill="#fff" stroke="#111827" stroke-width="2"/>
            <rect x="{{ c.rx }}" y="{{ c.ry }}" width="{{ c.rw }}" height="{{ c.rh }}" rx="12" fill="#fff" stroke="#111827" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <text x="{{ c.bx }}" y="{{ c.ty }}" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="700" fill="#111827">{{ c.text }}</text>
            {% endfor %}
          </svg>
          <div class="gauge-center">
            <div class="gauge-number">{{ "%.1f"|format(province_stat.avg) }}</div>
            <div class="gauge-scale">{{ province }} 평균 · 100점 만점</div>
            <div class="gauge-band-label" style="background:{{ province_stat.band_color }}; color:{{ province_stat.band_text }};">{{ province_stat.band_lo }}–{{ province_stat.band_hi }} 구간</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 1: 기상 -->
  <section class="spread" id="p1">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="sec-dot"></span>
      <div class="titles">
        <h2 class="page-title">오늘의 기상 조건</h2>
        <p class="lede">{{ narrative.weather_note }}</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="kpi-grid">
      <div class="kpi">
        <div class="kpi-head">기온</div>
        <div class="kpi-body">
          <div class="kpi-desc">{% if weather.uniform %}대표 관측{% else %}{{ "%.1f"|format(weather.temp_min) }} ~ {{ "%.1f"|format(weather.temp_max) }}{% endif %}</div>
          <div class="kpi-val">{{ "%.1f"|format(weather.temp_avg) }}<small> ℃</small></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="kpi">
        <div class="kpi-head">습도</div>
        <div class="kpi-body">
          <div class="kpi-desc">{% if weather.uniform %}대표 관측{% else %}{{ weather.humidity_min|round|int }} ~ {{ weather.humidity_max|round|int }}%{% endif %}</div>
          <div class="kpi-val">{{ weather.humidity_avg|round|int }}<small> %</small></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="kpi">
        <div class="kpi-head">풍속</div>
        <div class="kpi-body">
          <div class="kpi-desc">{% if weather.uniform %}대표 관측{% else %}{{ "%.1f"|format(weather.wind_min) }} ~ {{ "%.1f"|format(weather.wind_max) }}{% endif %}</div>
          <div class="kpi-val">{{ "%.1f"|format(weather.wind_avg) }}<small> m/s</small></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="kpi">
        <div class="kpi-head">강수</div>
        <div class="kpi-body">
          <div class="kpi-desc">{% if weather.uniform %}대표 관측{% else %}최대 {{ "%.1f"|format(weather.precip_max) }} mm{% endif %}</div>
          <div class="kpi-val">{{ "%.1f"|format(weather.precip_avg) }}<small> mm</small></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="copy" style="margin-top:8px">{{ narrative.weather_desc }}</p>
  </section>

  <!-- 2: 지역별 순위 -->
  <section class="spread" id="p2">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="sec-dot"></span>
      <div class="titles">
        <h2 class="page-title">지역별 산불위험지수 순위</h2>
        <p class="lede">{{ narrative.rank_summary }}</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="rank-block">
    <div class="rank-list{% if ranking_groups %} compact{% endif %}">
      {% if ranking_groups %}
        {% for group in ranking_groups %}
        <div class="rank-section">
          <div class="rank-section-label">{{ group.title }}</div>
          {% for row in group.rows %}
          <div class="rank-row{% if row.is_top %} top{% endif %}{% if row.is_highlight %} highlight{% endif %}">
            <span class="r">{{ row.rank }}</span>
            <span class="name">{{ row.name }}</span>
            <div class="rank-track"><div class="rank-fill" style="width:{{ row.width_pct }}%; background:{{ row.color }}"></div></div>
            <span class="val">{{ "%.1f"|format(row.idx) }}</span>
          </div>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
      {% else %}
        {% for row in ranking %}
        <div class="rank-row{% if row.is_top %} top{% endif %}{% if row.is_highlight %} highlight{% endif %}">
          <span class="r">{{ row.rank }}</span>
          <span class="name">{{ row.name }}</span>
          <div class="rank-track"><div class="rank-fill" style="width:{{ row.width_pct }}%; background:{{ row.color }}"></div></div>
          <span class="val">{{ "%.1f"|format(row.idx) }}</span>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    <div class="legend-bar">
      <div class="legend-items">
        {% for b in band_legend %}
        <span class="legend-item"><span class="dot" style="background:{{ b.color }}"></span>{{ b.lo }}–{{ b.hi }} 구간</span>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      <span class="legend-hint">{% if ranking_groups %}상위·하위 요약 · {% endif %}막대 길이 = 위험지수(0–100 기준) · 동일 지수는 같은 순위</span>
    </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 3: 전국 비교 -->
  <section class="spread" id="p3">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="sec-dot"></span>
      <div class="titles">
        {% if is_national %}
        <h2 class="page-title">전국 17개 시·도별 산불위험지수 비교</h2>
        <p class="lede">전국 {{ national.count }}개 시·군·구를 시·도 단위로 묶어 평균을 비교했습니다.</p>
        {% else %}
        <h2 class="page-title">{{ province }}{{ province_eun_neun }} 전국 {{ province_stat.count }}개 시·도 중 {{ province_stat.rank }}위</h2>
        <p class="lede">전국 {{ national.count }}개 시·군·구 분포 대비 {{ province }}의 위치를 표시했습니다.</p>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>

    {% if not is_national %}
    <div class="range-card">
      <div class="range-strip">
        <div class="range-track">
          <span style="background:#0D2F6B"></span><span style="background:#1E5AA8"></span>
          <span style="background:#0E7C8A"></span><span style="background:#3DB8E8"></span>
          <span style="background:#7BCB2E"></span><span style="background:#C5D94A"></span>
          <span style="background:#F2E14A"></span><span style="background:#F5B84A"></span>
          <span style="background:#F07A1A"></span><span style="background:#E53935"></span>
        </div>

        <div class="range-marker below" style="left:{{ national.min }}%"><span class="num">{{ "%.1f"|format(national.min) }}</span><span class="lbl">전국 최저</span><span class="stem"></span></div>
        <div class="range-marker" style="left:{{ national.avg }}%"><span class="lbl">전국 평균</span><span class="num">{{ national.avg }}</span><span class="stem"></span></div>
        <div class="range-marker emph below" style="left:{{ province_stat.avg }}%"><span class="num">{{ province_stat.avg }}</span><span class="lbl">{{ province }} 평균</span><span class="stem"></span></div>
        <div class="range-marker" style="left:{{ national.max }}%"><span class="lbl">전국 최고 · {{ national.max_name }}</span><span class="num">{{ "%.1f"|format(national.max) }}</span><span class="stem"></span></div>
      </div>
      <p class="footnote" style="margin-top:0">위험지수 0–100 전 구간 대비 위치 · 색상은 국가산불위험예보 10단계 배색과 동일</p>
    </div>
    {% endif %}

    <h3 class="section-label">시·도별 평균 위험지수</h3>
    <div class="prov-chart">
      <div class="prov-chart-meta">
        <div class="keys">
          <span class="key"><span class="swatch-bar"></span>시·도 평균</span>
          <span class="key"><span class="swatch-line"></span>전국 평균 {{ "%.1f"|format(national.avg) }}</span>
        </div>
        <span>내림차순 · 0–100</span>
      </div>
      {% for row in province_table %}
      <div class="prov-chart-row{% if loop.index is odd %} alt{% endif %}{% if row.is_target %} target{% endif %}">
        <span class="name">{{ row.name }}{% if row.is_target %} <span class="badge">{{ row.rank }}위</span>{% endif %}</span>
        <div class="prov-chart-track">
          <div class="prov-chart-fill" style="width:{{ row.width_pct }}%"></div>
          <div class="prov-chart-avg" style="left:{{ national.avg }}%"></div>
        </div>
        <span class="val">{{ "%.1f"|format(row.avg) }}</span>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="footnote">지수는 기상 4개 + 시군구 이력 2개 + 건조지수 + 강수파생 3개 변수를 결합한 상대값입니다. 점선은 전국 시군구 평균({{ "%.1f"|format(national.avg) }})입니다.</p>
  </section>

  <!-- 4: 상위 지역 상세 -->
  <section class="spread" id="p4">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="sec-dot"></span>
      <div class="titles">
        <h2 class="page-title">주요 지역 상세</h2>
        <p class="lede one-line">위험도 상위 5개 지역의 {% if is_national %}전국 평균({{ national.avg }}){% else %}{{ province }} 평균({{ province_stat.avg }})·전국 평균({{ national.avg }}){% endif %} 대비 위치와 기상 조건을 함께 표시했습니다.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="spot-list">
      {% for row in spotlight %}
      <div class="spot-row">
        <div class="spot-main">
          <div class="spot-head">
            <span class="spot-rank">{{ row.rank }}</span>
            <span class="spot-name">{{ row.name }}</span>
            <span class="chip"><span class="swatch" style="background:{{ row.color }}"></span>{{ row.band_lo }}–{{ row.band_hi }} 구간{% if row.is_highlight and not row.is_top %} · 조회 지역{% endif %}</span>
          </div>
          <div class="spot-idx">{{ "%.1f"|format(row.idx) }}<small> / 100</small></div>
          <div class="compare">
            {% for m in row.marks %}
            <i class="{{ 'self' if m.is_self else '' }}" style="left:{{ m.value }}%"></i>
            <em class="{{ 'self' if m.is_self else '' }}{{ ' below' if m.below else '' }}" style="left:{{ m.value }}%">{{ m.label }}</em>
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
        </div>
        <table class="wx-mini">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>기온</th>
              <th>습도</th>
              <th>풍속</th>
              <th>강수</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>{{ "%.1f"|format(row.weather.temp) }}<small> ℃</small></td>
              <td>{{ row.weather.humidity }}<small> %</small></td>
              <td>{{ "%.1f"|format(row.weather.wind) }}<small> m/s</small></td>
              <td>{{ "%.1f"|format(row.weather.precip) }}<small> mm</small></td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 5: 해석 및 안내 -->
  <section class="spread" id="p5">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="sec-dot"></span>
      <div class="titles">
        <h2 class="page-title">지수를 읽는 법</h2>
        <p class="lede">예측 지수의 의미와 일반 산불예방 수칙입니다.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="method-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="copy">
          위험지수는 XGBoost 일별 예측모델의 원시 확률(y_prob)에 100을 곱한 값입니다.
          산불은 매우 드문 사건이라 정밀도가 낮고, <strong>확률 보정(calibration)도 적용되지 않았습니다.</strong><br />
          따라서 이 지수는 "오늘 실제 산불이 날 절대 확률"이 아니라,<br />
          <strong>지역 간 상대적 위험 서열</strong>로 해석하는 것이 안전합니다.
        </p>
        <div class="stat-line"><span>모델</span><span>XGBoost (일별 시군구 단위)</span></div>
        <div class="stat-line"><span>ROC-AUC</span><span>{{ "%.4f"|format(metrics.roc_auc) if metrics.roc_auc is not none else "—" }}</span></div>
        <div class="stat-line"><span>PR-AUC</span><span>{{ "%.4f"|format(metrics.pr_auc) if metrics.pr_auc is not none else "—" }}</span></div>
        <div class="stat-line"><span>확률 보정</span><span>미적용</span></div>
        <div class="stat-line"><span>입력 변수</span><span>기상 4 · 이력 2 · 건조지수 · 강수파생 3</span></div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="section-label">일반 산불예방 수칙</h3>
        <ul class="guide">
          <li>산림 및 인접 지역에서는 화기 사용과 흡연을 자제하세요.</li>
          <li>논밭두렁 소각, 쓰레기 소각 등 실화 요인을 피하세요.</li>
          <li>건조하고 바람이 강한 날에는 입산을 자제하는 것이 안전합니다.</li>
          <li>산불을 발견하면 즉시 119 또는 산림청 산불신고 전화로 신고하세요.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="report-footer">
      <strong>자료 출처</strong> · 기상청 시간자료({{ weather_source }}) 기반 XGBoost 예측 · daily_ml_risk 데이터셋<br />
      <strong>리포트 생성</strong> · {{ generated_at }} · 본 리포트는 머신러닝 예측모델 기반 자동 생성 자료이며, 산림청 등 공식 산불예보와 다를 수 있습니다.
    </div>
  </section>

</div>
</body>
</html>
